22. Security Failure Handling

Security failures become cognition.

Example:

Event:

Unauthorized access attempt

Learning:

Improve permission boundary
23. Compliance

A MOS implementation complies with RFC-0012 if:

actions have governance context,
authority is explicit,
policies are versioned,
permissions are enforced,
sensitive memory is protected,
audits exist,
high-risk actions can require approval.
